	quest.01CB90EF050B5B9B.title: "Tritium"
	quest.0242C0C26A96FD89.quest_desc: [
		"Grim Soul Industries has its own simulator: the Reaper Virtualization Chamber. It runs on Soul Cards that level up as they're used. See the §5Grim Soul Industries§r chapter."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Virtualization Chamber and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.0242C0C26A96FD89.title: "Another Way to Simulate"
	quest.024C8622FD7594FE.quest_desc: [
		"Paper, iron, ender pearls and a compass. A bigger work area for the Reaper Block (up to 23x13x23), a longer push for the Fan, a wider magnet for the XP Tank and a bigger spawn area. Up to 10."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Range Card and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.024C8622FD7594FE.title: "Range Card"
	quest.02C780EB4AD01DF0.quest_desc: [
		"Wild onions grow in plains."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Onion and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.02C780EB4AD01DF0.title: "Onions"
	quest.02E1535B548B0D78.quest_desc: [
		"The Codex's safe farm: a Spawner with a No AI Card, its spawn area lined up with a Reaper Block's work area, and a Generator on §ePass§r eating the drops. The farm powers itself."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Spawner, 4 x Count Card and 16 x Speed Card and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.02E1535B548B0D78.title: "Spawner Farm"
	quest.032F77011D25F91C.quest_desc: [
