	quest.071B7F579D3EB531.title: "Batteries"
	quest.072097DEFCE90D1C.quest_desc: [
		"The Bumblezone is a whole dimension inside a beehive. Friendly bees, sticky honey, strange structures and a Bee Queen who hands out quests."
		""
		"§eHow to get in:§r throw an ender pearl at a beehive or bee nest. You'll teleport into the Bumblezone. To leave, fly or climb above y 256 (or below the bottom). Grab some honey bottles first."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 4 x Honey Bottle and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.072097DEFCE90D1C.title: "A Dimension of Bees"
