	quest.110D3ADE8B48EE09.quest_desc: [
		"Apothic Enchanting rebuilds enchanting from the ground up. The table has five stats: §eEterna§r (max level), §eQuanta§r (randomness), §eArcana§r (rarer enchants), Rectification and Clues."
		""
		"Different bookshelves change each stat. This chapter walks you from a vanilla setup to a table that rolls level 100+ enchantments. Get some lapis first."
