	quest.132D11B7197AAAD2.quest_desc: [
		"Powah is a tidy power mod with seven tiers: Starter, Basic, Hardened, Blazing, Niotic, Spirited and Nitro. Every machine comes in every tier, and each tier needs the crystal of that tier."
		""
