		"Open the map with §eM§r and use the chunk-claim screen to claim land. Claimed chunks are safe from griefing and explosions, and you can force-load a few so machines keep running while you are away."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 16 x Oak Fence and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
