	quest.17C5A7EAE1285CF9.quest_desc: [
		"Nine Craft is a big kitchen-sink pack: tech, magic, farming, bosses and a whole lot of building. There is no wrong way to play."
		""
		"This book is your map. Every chapter follows one mod or one theme from the very first item to its endgame. Nothing is locked behind quests, so treat them as signposts."
		""
		"§eFirst task:§r craft a crafting table so we know you're up and running."
		""
