	quest.192BF222A7420B2D.quest_desc: [
		"A Reaper Block, a Reaper Spawner, a Virtualization Chamber, a Soul Forge and an Energy Cell: the whole Grim Soul Industries line. Every mob in Nine Craft now works for you."
