	quest.192BF222A7420B2D.title: "Grim Soul Industrialist"
	quest.19308FAC4B393D56.quest_desc: [
		"The Fission Reactor burns fissile fuel for heat. The heat turns water or sodium into steam."
		""
		"§cWarning:§r if it runs out of coolant or overheats, it melts down and explodes with radiation. Always build a Logic Adapter that shuts it down when the temperature or damage gets too high."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Fission Reactor Casing and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
