	quest.1A62F189FFAB208D.title: "Yellow Cake"
	quest.1A653F4DD185B817.quest_desc: [
		"§eHow goo works:§r place Primordial Goo, then put an iron block on top of it. After a while, the iron turns into Ferricore Raw Ore. Mine it and smelt it. Goo only works with the right block on top, so check JEI."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Primogel Goo and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1A653F4DD185B817.title: "Primordial Goo"
	quest.1A68E7CCF9AAC103.quest_desc: [
		"Lets the Reaper Block's filter delete unwanted items instead of keeping them."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Void Card and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
