		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Crimson Iron Ingot and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1A6F8332F9261FB7.title: "Crimson Iron"
	quest.1A857B253402708E.quest_desc: [
		"A Crafting CPU is a multiblock of Crafting Storage blocks (and optional Co-Processing Units). Bigger storage lets you queue bigger crafts. Build it touching your network."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 1k Crafting Storage and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1A857B253402708E.title: "Crafting CPU"
	quest.1A87C9A5C997D8DC.quest_desc: [
		"Looting I to X, one level per card. It needs a Player Kill Card in the same machine to work."
