	quest.1C59C0E12A88BC5D.quest_desc: [
		"Inventory space runs out fast. A Sophisticated Backpack is cheap and upgrades a long way. Put it on your back slot to keep your hands free."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Backpack and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
