	quest.1CBEFF63345BCAB7.title: "Don't Go Hungry"
	quest.1CC0553775C14AFB.quest_desc: [
		"Create is about mechanical power: shafts, cogs, belts and moving machines. It doesn't use electricity at all."
		""
		"§eKey idea: stress.§r Every machine uses some stress units (SU). Every power source provides some. If your machines use more stress than you make, everything stops. Engineer's Goggles show you the numbers."
		""
		"The chapter goes from a hand crank all the way to trains and fully automated factories. Start with a stack of andesite."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 32 x Andesite and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1CC0553775C14AFB.title: "Rotational Power"
