	quest.1ECCE42D0A2030B8.title: "Warp Drive"
	quest.1ED03CA2FEF0DBFB.quest_desc: [
		"Grim Soul Industries is Nine Craft's own mob-farming mod, made by §dxTri6§r. It starts with a laser grinder you can build on day one and ends with farms that have no mobs in them at all."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r Tier I kills mobs with the Reaper Block. Tier II spawns your own mobs and burns their drops for power. Tier III simulates kills with Soul Cards. The Soul Forge is the endgame."
		""
		"Almost every recipe uses amethyst, so start by collecting some shards."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Amethyst Shard and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1ED03CA2FEF0DBFB.title: "§5Grim Soul Industries"
	quest.1ED0690D242EDCAC.quest_desc: [
		"Keeps a set amount of an item in a target."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Regulator Upgrade and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1ED0690D242EDCAC.title: "Regulator Upgrade"
	quest.1ED1A67F5A866D7A.quest_desc: [
		"The heart of every farm: iron, an iron sword, amethyst and redstone."
		""
		"Place it, open it and switch it on. It starts off and set to hostile mobs only, so it never zaps you by surprise. It fires a purple laser at every mob in its work area and pulls in their drops and XP."
		""
		"Turn on §eShow area§r to see the work area as an outline."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Block and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1ED1A67F5A866D7A.title: "Reaper Block"
