	quest.2159D954BBF16C90.title: "Genes"
	quest.219E864E5CBDC14E.quest_desc: [
		"The Nuclear Reactor is a big, flexible multiblock. You place fuel rods and coolant cells in the hatches in patterns; heat goes into coolant and turns water into steam."
		""
		"§eTip:§r start small with a few rods and plenty of cooling. Check the guidebook for tested layouts."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Nuclear Reactor and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.219E864E5CBDC14E.title: "Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.21B5970CFE4D2AB3.quest_desc: [
		"An Echo Soulite Shard, string and an ender pearl. Use it on the first Quantum Link, then on the second, to pair them."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Soul Tether and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.21B5970CFE4D2AB3.title: "Soul Tether"
	quest.21F5054F452C9265.quest_desc: [
		"The Abyss Eye leads you to the Sunken City, home of the Leviathan. Other bosses have their own eyes; each one is its own quest here."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot Eye of Abyss and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.21F5054F452C9265.title: "Boss Eyes"
