	quest.22EB1F42A10865C9.quest_desc: [
		"Quests with a §dhexagon§r border are milestones. Optional quests are side paths you can skip."
		""
		"Click a quest to read it, then click its task to hand in the items. Rewards are claimed with the button on the right. Start by crafting a book!"
