	quest.30469F77BFEE426C.title: "Hyper-Dense Drive"
	quest.305DA2F4EB0D1FF3.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism is about getting the most out of every ore. Early machines double your ingots, and by the end you'll be getting five ingots from every ore block."
		""
		"§eHow this chapter works:§r follow the line from left to right. The first few quests teach you the basic tools, then each ore-processing step builds on the one before. Side branches cover power, logistics and gear."
		""
		"Start by grabbing some raw copper. You'll need copper and osmium for almost everything."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Raw Copper and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.305DA2F4EB0D1FF3.title: "Break It Down"
