	quest.4312418F31B3C8A2.quest_desc: [
		"Modern Industrialization is a long, structured tech mod. It has four ages: Steam, Electric, Digital and Endgame. Each age unlocks the next one, so do them in order."
		""
		"§eThis chapter is the Steam Age.§r You'll make bronze machines that run on steam, build your first multiblocks and end up with steel. Start by collecting some bricks for the Coke Oven."
		""
